<title>JAPAN: Nissin Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissin Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 44.09		vs	   44.33</p>
<p> Operating	   56    million    vs	  359    million</p>
<p> Current	    798    million    vs	    1.22</p>
<p> Net		  433    million    vs	  662    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.02 yen	  vs	    6.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    108 million	  vs	 108 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissin Electric Co Ltd manufactures power capacitors for electric power companies and belongs to the Sumitomo Electric Industries Ltd group.</p>
</text>
